{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1000_p", "source_sha256": "af040469c6858a83f5d2989a2ddd10d8ab7e07b8ae23857d3db5c059718cbf6b", "ja": "（コスプレグラビア企画の撮影日。紗代子は\n猫と遊ぶシーンを撮ることになったのだが……）", "zh": "（Cosplay写真企划的拍摄日。纱代子要拍摄和猫咪玩耍的场景，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1001_027say", "source_sha256": "254d56608a952360a118545bcc612efe285cfcada6e5f47853a08ccf3a40746a", "ja": "はぁ……はぁ……おもちゃで引き寄せて。\n今度こそ、頭を撫で……ああ、行かないで～！", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……用玩具把它引过来。  \n这次一定要摸摸头……啊，别走啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1002_null", "source_sha256": "a1269628ae1a31b7c3027a5c36e0f5ec7f2b4dcc51bd33ce7866202fe4c2df78", "ja": "休憩中……", "zh": "休息中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1003_p", "source_sha256": "9cc65b447ddc0d99048210afb10c6f53dfca34c0177decb7538d5f7d2d19fc22", "ja": "お疲れ様、紗代子。\nだいぶ苦戦してたけど……その、大丈夫か？", "zh": "辛苦了，纱代子。\n看起来你挺费劲的……那个，没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1004_027say", "source_sha256": "bd4390a94d157129b30052b4adc48c1e3c73aef4cfe6e958bb36c001bb7cfb83", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}……。\n思ってた以上に、素早くてビックリしちゃいました。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}……\n没想到它比预想中还要敏捷，吓了我一跳。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1005_027say", "source_sha256": "3caf01ac7da3b1cbb9e6598495769546e8861941f0d3bf5ce8e69f20b0f53de7", "ja": "おいしいエサで、油断させたりしましたけど。\n少し動いただけで、逃げちゃうんですよね……。", "zh": "虽然用美味的饵食让它放松了警惕，但它稍微一动就逃走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1006_p", "source_sha256": "4b60e6c0dd9aee752f725abc9bbda0bd3732a72feec111411970258bca0a4d27", "ja": "そうだったな。猫は警戒心が強いというけど……。\n見事に翻弄されてたな。", "zh": "确实是这样。都说猫的戒心很强……  \n我们完全被它耍得团团转了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1007_027say", "source_sha256": "460715ab7ee69750d39c752298e3fc5f0254a0ae2c75ed1c1ffdb376e51e0525", "ja": "はい……。振り回されてるなぁって。\nでも、それがまた楽しくて……ふふっ。", "zh": "是啊……感觉一直被它耍得团团转。\n不过，这样也很开心……呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "53f65bc6f33bb931a18999849cf1e444f7e9718a1355e62f0053acfa30c40857", "ja": "私の様子を伺うみたいに、時々見つめてくれたりして。\nその姿が可愛いから、もっとやる気になります！", "zh": "有时还会像是在观察我的样子一样注视着我。因为那副模样很可爱，我就更有干劲了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1009_p", "source_sha256": "48a848301154b72a998d0810345623ccd589913f2e1e1846a3eea75b2f6cfec5", "ja": "まあ……紗代子が楽しんでるならよかったよ。", "zh": "嗯……纱代子能玩得开心就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1010_027say", "source_sha256": "a919b35abb301883ee682501395d997330c364287257781e7cd2c394c1260a2f", "ja": "はい！　このあとも全力で遊ぶために休憩を……\nあっ。その前に、作戦会議に付き合ってくれませんか？", "zh": "好的！为了接下来也能尽情玩乐，先休息一下……\n啊，对了。在那之前，能陪我开个作战会议吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1011_p", "source_sha256": "a0e60746f9fc40d111ee071206522f14dbb3c9075a78e694bfdb17c9452a47d2", "ja": "作戦会議……？", "zh": "作战会议……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "7090d2c10b9499d95ae1bdc5d8ba004a6718ed96cd917b1ec7ea7bf22edd73ae", "ja": "そうです。今は触ることもできませんけど……\nやっぱり、最高の写真を撮りたいじゃないですか！", "zh": "没错。虽然现在还不能碰它……\n但还是想拍下最棒的照片，对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1013_027say", "source_sha256": "3fccc61ebb5fd817cf6fbafcf0cc1e0281cfeff03b38a878944e18554a072a6c", "ja": "最高の写真……それは、私と猫のツーショットです！", "zh": "最高的照片……那就是我和猫咪的双人合照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e18032299419f63a233a3135550c62510685d674c4db8b78484d8b32948bf888", "ja": "確かに。それが撮れたら理想的だな。\n紗代子と猫、両方の可愛さを表現できるし。", "zh": "确实。要是能拍到那样的照片就太理想了。\n既能展现纱代子的可爱，又能展现猫咪的可爱。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1015_p", "source_sha256": "031220aaab72cfee127fcef0cf7bf2524ab596ff1fb8e3918ca32c35f29c16cf", "ja": "よし、一緒に作戦を考えよう！", "zh": "好，我们一起来想想作战策略吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "8b59078108a137a2fe99ba7d304d78231cccddef072faf70526aad2fbac92ebf", "ja": "ありがとうございます、{$P$}！\nふたりの力で、いい写真にしましょうね♪", "zh": "谢谢你，{$P$}！\n我们一起努力，拍出好照片吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_027say0553_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_027say0553_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ecae81a7f8106751aacd66dec6833a716052b98b634c6a03ed152a48cff8f472", "ja": "（作戦が功を奏し、紗代子と猫の\n可愛いツーショットが撮れた。よかったな、紗代子！）", "zh": "（计划奏效了，终于拍到了纱代子和猫咪的可爱双人照。太好了，纱代子！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
